<title>KAZAKHSTAN: Kazakh tenge rises to 75.3800 to dlr.</title>
<headline>Kazakh tenge rises to 75.3800 to dlr.</headline>
<dateline>ALMATY 1997-03-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>The tenge closed at 75.3800 per dollar on the Kazakhstan Currency Exchange on Wednesday after 75.5400 on Tuesday.</p>
<p> TENGE PER DOLLAR	     Mar 12		  Mar 11</p>
<p> High			     75.3800		 75.4100</p>
<p> Low				75.5500		 75.6299</p>
<p> Open			     75.4701		 75.4100</p>
<p> Close			    75.3800		 75.5400</p>
<p> Volume ($ mln)		  4.260		   0.780</p>
<p> TENGE PER MARK		 Mar 12		  Mar 11</p>
<p> High			     44.2800		 44.9700</p>
<p> Low				44.7500		 45.0000</p>
<p> Open			     44.7500		 44.9700</p>
<p> Close			    44.3500		 45.0000</p>
<p> Volume ($ mln)		  0.100		   0.015</p>
<p>--Almaty Newsroom, + 7 3272 509410</p>
